{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48987","headline":"又题牡丹上主人司空 · 孙鲂","name":"又题牡丹上主人司空","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一年芳胜一年芳，爱重贤侯意异常。\n手辟红房看阔狭，自张青幄盖馨香。\n白疑美玉无多润，紫觉灵芝不是祥。\n秪恐梦徵他日去，又须疑向凤池傍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}